<div className={styles.pvlRoot}>
	{{block('/-/block/hero_full.html?variant=7-baf5e7c9fb-ft6b90')}}
	<div class="row my-3 p-6 rounded-5 bg-light mb-18">
		<div class="col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
			<h5 style="text-align:center;">Ways to Support Us</h5>
			<div class="py-5"></div>
			<p style="text-align:center;">When you support The Salvation Army of Oconee County, you're making a positive impact on lives of our most vulnerable neighbors. There are many ways you can help support our mission programs in our community.&nbsp;</p>
			<div class="my-2"></div>
			<div class="row my-3 g-3 align-items-stretch">
				<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-12 col-sm-12 d-flex flex-column">
					<div class="pvlRichtext card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align:center"><div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align:center;"><h5 style="text-align:center;">Donate Funds</h5>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	To donate by phone, please call 1-800-SAL-ARMY (<a href="tel:1-800-725-2769" target="">1-800-725-2769</a>).
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	To text to give, text&nbsp;<strong>OconeeOnline</strong> to 41444.
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	Mail checks to: The Salvation Army, 100 Debra Street, Seneca, SC 29678.
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	To make a donation online, click the button below.
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center"><a href="https://give.salvationarmycarolinas.org/give/364745/#!/donation/checkout" class="btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2">Donate</a></p></div></div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-12 col-sm-12 d-flex flex-column">
					<div class="pvlRichtext card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align:center"><div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align: center;">
<h5 style="text-align: center;">Volunteer</h5>
<p style="text-align: center;">We are always looking for committed, dedicated volunteers to help us Do the Most Good in Oconee County, SC.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">If you're interested in learning more about volunteer opportunities with us, please contact Debra Andrews at <a href="tel://8648821160" target="_blank" rel="noopener">864-882-1160 </a>or email <a href="mailto://debra.andrews@uss.salvationarmy.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Debra.Andrews@uss.salvationarmy.org</a>.&nbsp;</p>
</div></div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-12 col-sm-12 d-flex flex-column">
					<div class="pvlRichtext card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align:center"><div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align:center;"><h5 style="text-align:center;">Red Kettle Campaign</h5>

<p style="text-align:center;">
	All funds raised through our annual Red Kettle Campaign remain in Oconee County to help support our service programs throughout the year.
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center"><a href="https://migration.salvationarmy.org/greenvillesc/red-kettle-campaign-1" class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2">Learn More</a></p></div></div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="my-2"></div>
			<div class="row my-3">
				<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
					<div class="pvlRichtext card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align:center"><div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align: center;">
<h5 style="text-align: center;">Angel Tree Program</h5>
<p style="text-align: center;">Holidays often bring added stress to already difficult financial situations. The Salvation Army is here to lend a helping hand to families and vulnerable adults struggling during this time. We help provide Christmas gifts, coats and shoes to children ages 0 to 12 years of age and vulnerable adults.&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Click below to learn how you can help make the holidays a little more bright for these individuals.</p>
<p class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center" style="text-align: center;"><a class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2" href="https://www.salvationarmyusa.org/sc/seneca/debra-st/angel-tree-of-oconee-county/">Learn More</a></p>
</div></div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
					<div class="pvlRichtext card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align:center"><div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align: center;">
<h5 style="text-align: center;">Food Pantry donations</h5>
<p style="text-align: center;">During times of crisis, The Salvation Army is here to lend a helping hand. The Salvation Army helps Oconee residents with emergency need of non-perishable grocery items. You can help donate non-perishable items to support our neighbors in need. For more information, call 864-882-1160.</p>
<p class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center" style="text-align: center;"><a class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2" href="https://www.salvationarmyusa.org/sc/seneca/debra-st/hunger/">Learn More</a></p>
</div></div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-sm-12">
					<div class="pvlRichtext card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align:center"><div class="card-wysiwyg-body d-flex flex-column h-100 w-100 flex-fill rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark card-outline border border-secondary-subtle" style="text-align: center;">
<h5 style="text-align: center;">Follow Us</h5>
<p style="text-align: center;">Follow us on social media to stay up to date on the latest happenings with The Salvation Army of Oconee, and learn how you can get involved.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/salarmyoconee" class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2">Facebook</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/salarmyoconee/" class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2">Instagram</a></p>
</div></div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="row bg-light p-6 rounded-5 mb-18">
				<div class="column p-6 rounded-5 bg-light mb-18"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>